<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were $0.50 higher in moderately active trade. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers - Load Choice Blacks predominantly 3, near 1430 lbs 68.75. High Select and Choice 2-3, 1250-1400 lbs 64.50-67.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers - High Select and Choice 2-3, 1050-1200 lbs</p>
<p>64.50-66.00, early.</p>
</text>
